@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@accessToken = 여기에 user access token

### 포토카드 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/photo-cards
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Winter Special Card",
  "grade": "RARE",
  "genre": "SPECIAL",
  "minPrice": 1000,
  "description": "Winter special photocard",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/photo-card.png",
  "totalQuantity": 10
}

### 마이갤러리 내 보유 카드 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/photo-cards/me?page=1&limit=10&sort=recent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
